scn 1
# Maze formation: a 64-body formation through a serpentine of four baffles (each
# closes most of the lane, the gaps alternate ends).
# Geometry is crowdbench's `maze` lane for 64 units (stride 3, 8 rows x 8 columns, lane z 26-63, map 384x128),
# but ONE formation: all 64 bodies get one click at (340, 48) (crowdbench gives each its own goal).
# Source: tools/crowdbench.cpp maze (the maze spin regression).
name mazeform
ticks 9000
seed 7
map flat 384 128
wall 0 24 384 2
wall 0 64 384 2
wall 80 26 4 26
wall 112 38 4 26
wall 144 26 4 26
wall 176 38 4 26
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
group A 0 m 64 cells 53,36 53,39 53,42 53,45 53,48 53,51 53,54 53,57 50,36 50,39 50,42 50,45 50,48 50,51 50,54 50,57 47,36 47,39 47,42 47,45 47,48 47,51 47,54 47,57 44,36 44,39 44,42 44,45 44,48 44,51 44,54 44,57 41,36 41,39 41,42 41,45 41,48 41,51 41,54 41,57 38,36 38,39 38,42 38,45 38,48 38,51 38,54 38,57 35,36 35,39 35,42 35,45 35,48 35,51 35,54 35,57 32,36 32,39 32,42 32,45 32,48 32,51 32,54 32,57
line b1 84 0 84 128
line b2 116 0 116 128
line b3 148 0 148 128
line b4 180 0 180 128
at 1 move A 340 48
